\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Ablation over the product-measure query fraction $\rho $ (\textsc  {Gas-Pce}). The $\eta _\mu - \eta _\nu $ gap at $\rho =0$ is Proposition~3 in action: a student fitted only on the data manifold has no certificate.}}{15}{table.7}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:ablation-rho}{{7}{15}{Ablation over the product-measure query fraction $\rho $ (\GASPCE ). The $\eta _\mu - \eta _\nu $ gap at $\rho =0$ is Proposition~3 in action: a student fitted only on the data manifold has no certificate}{table.7}{}}
